    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >?? Movie Theater is a narrative oriented psychological horror in which one high school boy experiences what happened to him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcStory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a funny movie theater where you can watch any kind of movie. I saw a movie here. It is a story of a high school boy \u201cSota Sakurai\u201d until \u203b\u203b\u203b\u203b\u203b\u203b.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcGame Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFirst-person horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbA psychological terror in which the protagonist's world gradually collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAn epic story that unfolds from the daily life of one high school boy to the secrets of the world and his outlook on life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbGame design that emphasizes storytelling, does not require high play skill, and makes it easy to reach the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbTwo endings + one hidden ending.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcEstimated playing time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 1.5 to 3 hours</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bc About Video Distribution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDistribution is available to both individuals and corporations without permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMonetization is only possible when using the functions provided by the video distribution site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbWe would appreciate it if you include the name of the game in the title of your video or live broadcast, or include a link to the Steam page in the summary section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will not be liable for any damages caused by the distribution of videos of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The contents of these guidelines are subject to change without notice.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >?? Movie Theater is a narrative oriented psychological horror in which one high school boy experiences what happened to him.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcStory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a funny movie theater where you can watch any kind of movie. I saw a movie here. It is a story of a high school boy \u201cSota Sakurai\u201d until \u203b\u203b\u203b\u203b\u203b\u203b.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcGame Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFirst-person horror game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbA psychological terror in which the protagonist's world gradually collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAn epic story that unfolds from the daily life of one high school boy to the secrets of the world and his outlook on life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbGame design that emphasizes storytelling, does not require high play skill, and makes it easy to reach the ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbTwo endings + one hidden ending.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bcEstimated playing time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 1.5 to 3 hours</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25bc About Video Distribution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDistribution is available to both individuals and corporations without permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMonetization is only possible when using the functions provided by the video distribution site.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbWe would appreciate it if you include the name of the game in the title of your video or live broadcast, or include a link to the Steam page in the summary section.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will not be liable for any damages caused by the distribution of videos of this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The contents of these guidelines are subject to change without notice.</p>",
